	(text "pin 1 DIO-A = HOST TX = THIS BOARD'S RX.  pin 4 DIO-B = this board's TX.\nR29003 IS A POLYFUSE POSITION, NOT PROTECTION.  The 0.36R part is a\njumper.  Port 5 V is a shared 1.0 A that also feeds the pyControl\ncontroller's own logic regulator, with no per-port fuse — a fault here\ncan reset the controller.  Populate a 1206 PPTC, 250-500 mA hold.\nPins 3/5/7 are host driver outputs or a port-dependent DIO-C.  Leave NC.\nNOT ETHERNET.  No magnetics."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
